sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Proxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>(cluster mode)
    participant API as EvalHub API Server<br/>Optional TLS 1.2-1.3
    participant MCP as EvalHub MCP Server<br/>stdio / HTTP / SSE
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>pgx/v5 + otelsql
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant OTel as OTel Collector<br/>OTLP gRPC/HTTP
    participant MLflow as MLflow<br/>Results Export

    Note over Client,MLflow: Evaluation Job Creation Flow

    Client->>Proxy: POST /api/v1/evaluations/jobs<br/>X-User, X-Tenant headers
    Proxy->>API: Forward with identity headers<br/>AuthTypeRBACProxy
    API->>API: canContinueRequest()<br/>Validate X-User, X-Tenant
    API->>API: Extract/generate X-Global-Transaction-Id<br/>as Request ID (UUID)

    API->>PG: Store evaluation job<br/>otelsql instrumented
    PG-->>API: Job record created

    API->>K8s: Create Job (batch/v1)<br/>ServiceAccount auth
    API->>K8s: Create ConfigMap<br/>Job configuration
    API->>K8s: Create Secret<br/>Job credentials
    K8s-->>API: Resources created

    API->>OTel: Export trace span<br/>OTLP/gRPC or OTLP/HTTP
    API-->>Proxy: JSON Response
    Proxy-->>Client: 200 OK

    Note over Client,MLflow: MCP Tool Invocation Flow

    Client->>MCP: MCP tool call<br/>stdio or Streamable HTTP
    MCP->>MCP: wrapRequest()<br/>AuthTypeRBACProxy or AuthTypeNone
    MCP->>API: Delegate to API logic
    API->>PG: Query data
    PG-->>API: Results
    API-->>MCP: Response
    MCP-->>Client: MCP result

    Note over Client,MLflow: Init Container Flow

    Note right of S3: Runs at pod startup
    API->>S3: Download test data<br/>AWS SDK v2
    S3-->>API: Test data artifacts

    Note over Client,MLflow: Results Export Flow

    API->>MLflow: Export evaluation results<br/>mlflowclient
    MLflow-->>API: Export confirmed
